# Never commit secrets or weights
*.pem
*.key
*.gguf
*.bin
*.ggml
.env
secrets/
staging/

# Local operator / test signing outputs (never public feed path)
*.envelope.json
generated-candidates/test-keys/

# Unsigned generated catalog payloads are LOCAL BUILD OUTPUT only.
# GitHub Pages serves this repo from branch main at path "/" (repository root),
# so committing these files would make them web-reachable after push.
# Authoring SSoT remains registry-source/; regenerate via registry-prepare.
generated-candidates/**
!generated-candidates/README.md
